  "statuteText": "40:4-e Use of Ballot for Town Meeting Articles. –\n\nNo question submitted to voters at a town meeting or election pursuant to RSA 39:3-d shall be submitted by use of a question printed on the official ballot unless that form of submission is specifically authorized or required by law."
